## 📋 PROJECT STRUCTURE AWARENESS

### Relay Types
1. **Standard Relay:** Middle/guard relay (low maintenance, home-suitable)
2. **Exit Relay:** Final hop to internet (HIGH legal risk, NOT for home)
3. **SOCKS Proxy:** Local network proxy (experimental, LAN only)

### Key Directories
```
roles/
├── docker_setup/          # Docker installation
├── anon_relay_base/       # Base relay setup (shared)
├── anon_relay_standard/   # Standard relay config
├── anon_relay_exit/       # Exit relay config
├── anon_relay_socks/      # SOCKS proxy config
├── anon_relay_monitor/    # Monitoring (Nyx)
├── security_hardening/    # SSH, UFW, Fail2Ban
└── network_config/        # Port forwarding, firewall

group_vars/
├── all.yml                # Global settings
├── standard_relays.yml    # Standard relay vars
├── exit_relays.yml        # Exit relay vars
└── socks_proxies.yml      # SOCKS proxy vars
```

