## 📝 DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS

### Variable Documentation
Every variable in `defaults/main.yml` MUST have a comment:
```yaml
---
# Docker Configuration
# Docker edition to install (ce = Community Edition)
docker_edition: 'ce'

# Anon Relay Configuration
# Relay nickname displayed on Anyone network (max 19 characters, alphanumeric)
anon_relay_nickname: "MyAnonRelay"

# Contact email for relay operator (publicly visible, required)
anon_relay_contact: "operator@example.com"
```

### Task Documentation
Complex tasks need inline comments:
```yaml
- name: Configure exit relay with restrictive policy
  template:
    src: anonrc_exit.j2
    dest: /opt/anon/etc/anon/anonrc
    mode: '0644'
  # Exit policy blocks high-risk ports (SMTP, RDP, etc.)
  # See DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md Phase 5 for policy rationale
  notify: restart anon relay
```

