## 🎯 RELAY-SPECIFIC RULES

### Standard Relay
```yaml
# Required settings
anon_relay_type: "standard"
anon_relay_or_port: 9001
anon_relay_socks_port: 0  # MUST be disabled

# Port forwarding required
anon_port_forward_required: true
```

### Exit Relay
```yaml
# CRITICAL: Legal acknowledgment required
anon_exit_legal_acknowledged: true  # MUST be set

# Exit policy MUST be restrictive
anon_relay_exit_policy:
  - "reject *:25"      # Block SMTP
  - "reject *:587"     # Block SMTP Submission
  - "reject *:3389"    # Block RDP
  - "accept *:*"       # Allow others

# Enhanced security REQUIRED
anon_ssh_port: [non-standard]  # NOT 22
anon_fail2ban_enabled: true
anon_dos_circuit_creation_enabled: true
```

### SOCKS Proxy
```yaml
# Local network only
anon_relay_type: "socks"
anon_relay_or_port: 0  # MUST be disabled
anon_socks_bind_address: "192.168.x.x"  # LAN IP only
anon_socks_policy_accept: "192.168.x.0/24"  # Subnet only
```

