## 🚫 COMMON MISTAKES TO AVOID

### ❌ DON'T DO THIS
```yaml
# Missing state parameter
- name: Install package
  apt:
    name: docker-ce

# Hardcoded values
- name: Create directory
  file:
    path: /opt/anon
    state: directory

# Shell without changed_when
- name: Check status
  shell: docker ps | grep anon

# Generic variable names
- name: Set port
  set_fact:
    port: 9001
```

### ✅ DO THIS
```yaml
# Explicit state parameter
- name: Ensure Docker is installed
  apt:
    name: docker-ce
    state: present

# Parameterized values
- name: Ensure anon directory exists
  file:
    path: "{{ anon_base_dir }}"
    state: directory
    mode: '0755'

# Shell with changed_when
- name: Check anon relay status
  shell: docker ps | grep anon-relay
  register: relay_status
  changed_when: false
  failed_when: false

# Namespaced variables
- name: Set relay OR port
  set_fact:
    anon_relay_or_port: 9001
```

