## 🎨 JINJA2 TEMPLATE PATTERNS

### Template Header
```jinja2
{# {{ ansible_managed }} #}
{# Anon Relay Configuration #}
{# Generated: {{ template_run_date }} #}
{# Host: {{ inventory_hostname }} #}
{# Relay Type: {{ anon_relay_type }} #}

```

### Conditional Blocks
```jinja2
{% if anon_relay_bandwidth_rate is defined %}
BandwidthRate {{ anon_relay_bandwidth_rate }}
{% endif %}

{% if anon_relay_type == "exit" %}
ExitRelay 1
{% for policy in anon_relay_exit_policy %}
ExitPolicy {{ policy }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
SocksPort 0
{% endif %}
```

